+---
+
+## 7. Open questions
+
+- **Q1 — Should we lift Phase 3 (ERP invalid-sig tests) into a follow-up
+  project?** **Recommendation: yes** — the seed-side unblock is the
+  binary deliverable Engineer SSS filed for; Phase 3 should live in a
+  scoped product-side follow-up where the runner can install
