+
+---
+
+## 8. Risks
+
+- **Existing tests using bare keys against a default-schema client:**
+  storage path changes from `"foo"` to `"public.foo"`. All 78 existing
+  mock tests pass under the qualified scheme, confirming the
+  equivalence. *Mitigated.*
+- **Tests that read `_tables` directly:** would break if they assumed
+  bare keys. None found via grep. *Mitigated.*
+- **`schema()` no longer calls `__init__`:** uses `__new__` + manual
+  attribute assignment to share storage by reference. Future
+  constructor additions need either an `_init_shared` helper or a
+  re-pass here. *Logged as a maintenance note in `findings.md`.*
+
